Override any of them with `--set key=value` or with your own values file:

```bash
helm install jaeger ./charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }} -f values.custom.yaml
```

For task-oriented configuration examples see the [Configuration Overview](https://github.com/Netcracker/qubership-jaeger/blob/main/docs/examples.md),
